WEBVTT

01:37.920 --> 01:40.700
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.330 --> 01:43.670
[Episode 28]

01:47.000 --> 01:47.509
Kneel!

01:50.039 --> 01:50.759
Master,

01:51.400 --> 01:52.350
we split up into 2 teams

01:52.350 --> 01:53.950
to pursue those human pills.

01:54.150 --> 01:55.590
With the 2 Guardians presiding over it,

01:55.590 --> 01:58.120
all disciples of the Sun Moon Cavern
have been captured.

01:58.120 --> 01:59.920
Several disciples from Lingji Mountain
and Tianyuan Sect

01:59.920 --> 02:01.430
are still on the run.

02:01.870 --> 02:04.330
We've sent someone
to continue the pursuit.

02:06.200 --> 02:06.710
This is

02:07.150 --> 02:09.360
the Young Sect Master of Lingji Mountain.

02:09.360 --> 02:10.520
He killed Wenyin.

02:13.030 --> 02:14.520
Lin An's son,

02:14.870 --> 02:16.600
at the Foundation Establishment?

02:16.600 --> 02:17.840
You know my father's name, yet you

02:17.840 --> 02:19.030
still dare to tie me up.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.630
Aren't you afraid my father will come

02:20.630 --> 02:23.030
and level your Qinghong Sect
to the ground?

02:24.800 --> 02:25.750
Look at yourselves,

02:25.750 --> 02:27.010
you bunch of monsters.

02:27.150 --> 02:28.030
How dare you call yourselves

02:28.030 --> 02:29.750
the Phoenix Gods of North Xiang?

02:29.750 --> 02:30.870
If you have the guts,

02:30.870 --> 02:32.270
go to the Central Plains.

02:32.430 --> 02:33.120
You are even worse

02:33.120 --> 02:34.190
than wild chickens!

02:34.190 --> 02:34.920
How dare you!

02:40.470 --> 02:41.070
Xu Feng...

02:43.120 --> 02:44.050
Xu Feng, wake up!

02:44.360 --> 02:44.870
Xu Feng!

02:45.310 --> 02:45.840
Xu Feng!

02:47.590 --> 02:49.030
While he's still breathing,

02:49.030 --> 02:50.590
we can extract his immortal perception,

02:50.590 --> 02:52.030
so it won't go to waste.

02:54.910 --> 02:55.970
What are you doing?

02:56.180 --> 02:57.500
Where are you taking him?

02:57.500 --> 02:58.900
Where are you taking him?

02:59.079 --> 03:00.280
Fu Tian, you bastard!

03:00.400 --> 03:01.840
I swear I will kill you!

03:03.560 --> 03:04.280
Xu Feng!

03:05.080 --> 03:06.430
I'm going to kill you today!

03:06.430 --> 03:08.160
-I'll kill you!
-Take him away.

03:09.470 --> 03:10.000
Go.

03:15.470 --> 03:17.280
We need to quickly catch and bring back

03:17.280 --> 03:18.880
those from Lingji Mountain.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.650
We can't let them escape the desert.

03:20.650 --> 03:21.680
Otherwise, we won't have enough people

03:21.680 --> 03:22.810
or enough quantity.

03:22.960 --> 03:23.910
The aptitude of these human pills

03:23.910 --> 03:24.710
is quite good.

03:24.910 --> 03:26.960
There are even
a few Nascent Soul cultivators among them.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.360
Especially the male cultivator

03:28.360 --> 03:30.890
who escaped from the paper mill
a few days ago.

03:31.150 --> 03:32.430
We kept him here

03:32.560 --> 03:35.020
in order to translate
the War Demons' books.

03:35.030 --> 03:36.000
And the books

03:36.680 --> 03:38.840
have already been sent back
to the Central Plains.

03:38.840 --> 03:39.960
I bet the Overlord

03:40.150 --> 03:41.480
will be very satisfied.

03:43.280 --> 03:45.210
Given what you're saying, Master,

03:45.430 --> 03:47.430
do you plan
to let that male cultivator go?

03:47.430 --> 03:48.690
You need to say no more.

03:49.150 --> 03:50.950
The Master has his own judgment.

03:51.150 --> 03:52.310
His own judgment?

03:53.120 --> 03:54.750
I'm afraid
he is just holding onto old ties

03:54.750 --> 03:55.960
and being irresolute.

03:55.960 --> 03:56.690
How dare you!

03:57.190 --> 03:57.960
Lord Baori,

03:58.870 --> 04:00.030
this is North Xiang,

04:00.430 --> 04:02.430
the territory of our Qinghong Sect.

04:02.710 --> 04:04.040
As long as you stay here,

04:04.280 --> 04:05.190
you are just a member

04:05.190 --> 04:06.400
of the Qinghong Sect.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.840
You must know your place.

04:21.680 --> 04:22.630
Vajra Xunmu.

04:26.430 --> 04:28.630
Do you have any instructions, Lord Tiling?

04:28.630 --> 04:29.270
Who rescued

04:29.270 --> 04:30.680
Lu Qianqiao that day?

04:32.310 --> 04:33.300
How would I know?

04:33.680 --> 04:34.590
You don't know?

04:35.240 --> 04:37.840
You are in charge
of the paper mill's security.

04:38.040 --> 04:39.310
An outsider casually

04:39.310 --> 04:40.040
sneaked in

04:40.040 --> 04:41.360
and rescued him.

04:42.190 --> 04:43.430
You don't know?

04:44.390 --> 04:45.159
About this matter,

04:45.159 --> 04:47.190
I have already pleaded guilty
to the Cult Leader.

04:47.190 --> 04:48.360
I messed up.

04:48.680 --> 04:50.120
But as for who that person was

04:50.120 --> 04:51.180
and how they got in,

04:51.310 --> 04:52.440
I have no idea at all.

04:52.920 --> 04:54.000
After all, I'm just a lowly cultivator

04:54.000 --> 04:55.730
at Foundation Establishment.

04:55.980 --> 04:56.900
Lord Tiling,

04:56.930 --> 04:58.480
you're a superior cultivator
at the Void Stage.

04:58.480 --> 04:59.830
Wouldn't it be a piece of cake

04:59.830 --> 05:01.290
for you to bring them back?

05:09.750 --> 05:13.500
[Yunmo Inn]

05:14.630 --> 05:15.630
Are you all right?

05:18.680 --> 05:19.480
How about you?

05:19.830 --> 05:21.560
You were also injured just now.

05:22.240 --> 05:22.950
I'm fine.

05:25.040 --> 05:25.870
Who are the people

05:25.870 --> 05:27.000
chasing us just now?

05:27.190 --> 05:28.870
Are they from the Wushuang Society?

05:28.870 --> 05:29.430
The Wushuang Society

05:29.430 --> 05:30.600
doesn't have that many cultivators.

05:30.600 --> 05:31.920
I'm afraid they're the forces
from North Xiang.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.430
Even a mighty dragon
cannot suppress the local snake.

05:33.430 --> 05:35.290
We must leave as soon as possible.

05:45.600 --> 05:46.800
Don't worry, Junior.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.240
With you here with me,

05:52.560 --> 05:53.490
I'm not worried.

06:02.480 --> 06:03.560
The Master told us to catch

06:03.560 --> 06:04.720
those from the Wushuang Society.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.850
I thought they were just a few mortals,

06:07.040 --> 06:08.640
and it would be an easy catch.

06:09.360 --> 06:11.690
I didn't expect it
to be this much trouble.

06:11.830 --> 06:13.360
Things are unpredictable.

06:13.560 --> 06:15.160
It's all those demonic cultivators' fault.

06:15.160 --> 06:16.290
Were it not for them,

06:16.310 --> 06:17.830
we wouldn't have come here,

06:17.830 --> 06:19.430
nor ended up in such trouble.

06:20.240 --> 06:21.640
Demonic cultivators...

06:23.480 --> 06:25.610
Are they really demonic cultivators?

06:28.240 --> 06:28.950
Senior Bai?

06:33.040 --> 06:33.920
I ran into some heretical cultivators

06:33.920 --> 06:35.390
practicing demonic techniques before.

06:35.390 --> 06:37.360
Relying on their superior powers,

06:37.600 --> 06:38.360
they killed the innocent at will

06:38.360 --> 06:39.920
and treated human lives like nothing.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.920
Their eyes were like those of beasts,

06:41.920 --> 06:43.270
with no trace of joy or sorrow,

06:43.270 --> 06:45.000
only filled with cruelty and greed.

06:45.000 --> 06:46.240
Just one look at them was enough

06:46.240 --> 06:48.300
to tell that they had become demonic.

06:48.630 --> 06:50.630
But those from the Wushuang Society

06:51.040 --> 06:51.900
are different.

06:52.510 --> 06:53.840
How are they different?

06:54.360 --> 06:55.820
Their eyes are very clear.

07:02.870 --> 07:04.600
Most of them are ordinary people,

07:04.600 --> 07:06.070
too weak to even defend themselves.

07:06.070 --> 07:07.430
But they are very courageous.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.760
They seem very certain,

07:09.040 --> 07:10.680
not having even the slightest doubt

07:10.680 --> 07:11.880
in what they believe.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.330
But what do they believe in?

07:14.950 --> 07:16.550
They believe they are right.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.260
They believe their deaths

07:20.240 --> 07:21.240
are valuable.

07:22.510 --> 07:24.440
What exactly are you trying to say?

07:25.870 --> 07:27.000
I don't know either.

07:27.950 --> 07:29.480
I'm just a little confused.

07:32.390 --> 07:33.050
Senior Bai,

07:33.950 --> 07:35.630
we are both disciples
of the immortal sect

07:35.630 --> 07:37.800
and also Heavenly Talents
born on September 9th.

07:37.800 --> 07:39.460
We still need to save the world

07:39.560 --> 07:40.820
and rescue the people.

07:40.970 --> 07:42.000
We will do whatever

07:42.000 --> 07:42.940
the Sect says.

07:43.480 --> 07:44.680
Why overthink it?

07:46.159 --> 07:47.220
Heavenly Talents.

07:47.990 --> 07:48.990
Do you believe it?

07:49.040 --> 07:49.840
Of course I do.

07:51.000 --> 07:51.720
But

07:52.070 --> 07:53.270
there are too many people in this world

07:53.270 --> 07:54.530
born on September 9th.

07:54.920 --> 07:57.050
Not everyone is necessarily a savior.

07:58.270 --> 07:59.070
But I know

08:00.480 --> 08:01.610
you definitely are.

08:03.270 --> 08:03.950
Why?

08:05.270 --> 08:06.470
It's hard to explain,

08:06.600 --> 08:08.660
but I've thought so since childhood.

08:08.920 --> 08:09.510
Do you still believe

08:09.510 --> 08:11.310
in the Crazy Taoist's prophecy?

08:11.750 --> 08:12.600
He said that among
the Heavenly Talents born

08:12.600 --> 08:13.950
on September 9th,

08:14.160 --> 08:16.090
there will be a savior of the world.

08:16.360 --> 08:17.690
I really used to believe

08:18.000 --> 08:19.400
that person would be you.

08:20.680 --> 08:21.940
Get some rest, Junior.

08:22.040 --> 08:23.970
I'll go check on the other juniors.

08:37.030 --> 08:38.320
Come on, bear with it.

08:38.960 --> 08:40.620
Here you are, have some water.

08:41.320 --> 08:42.049
Are you okay?

08:42.120 --> 08:42.669
Alright.

08:43.120 --> 08:43.630
Gently, gently.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.320
Bear with it.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.580
Here, have some water.

08:46.270 --> 08:46.730
Come on.

08:53.870 --> 08:54.930
Someone's coming.

08:56.750 --> 08:57.410
Senior Bai,

08:57.660 --> 08:58.790
Senior Sima is back.

08:59.030 --> 08:59.600
Open the door.

08:59.600 --> 09:00.030
Yes.

09:00.360 --> 09:01.160
Open the door.

09:04.030 --> 09:05.030
Quickly, come on.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.870
Come on, take it slow.

09:07.620 --> 09:08.440
-Help me.
-Be careful.

09:08.440 --> 09:09.100
Hold him up.

09:09.910 --> 09:10.630
Sit down.

09:10.840 --> 09:11.750
I'll get you some medicine.

09:11.750 --> 09:12.610
What happened?

09:13.270 --> 09:14.270
We were ambushed.

09:14.530 --> 09:15.600
You were ambushed, too?

09:15.600 --> 09:16.840
Apply the medicine now.

09:16.840 --> 09:18.040
Do you know who did it?

09:19.480 --> 09:20.120
No idea.

09:20.480 --> 09:21.510
Where is Lin Muhan?

09:21.510 --> 09:22.510
We got separated.

09:23.790 --> 09:24.600
Go rest up.

09:27.060 --> 09:28.470
Come on, have some water.

09:29.040 --> 09:29.510
Here.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.240
Gently.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.300
Alright, alright.

09:46.910 --> 09:48.770
Senior, it's time for us to leave.

09:52.200 --> 09:53.910
The Sect Master ordered that

09:54.320 --> 09:56.000
once we're done
with the Wushuang Society's matters,

09:56.000 --> 09:58.200
we must return to the sect immediately.

09:58.510 --> 09:59.630
The juniors from Lingji Mountain

09:59.630 --> 10:00.750
all have leg injuries.

10:00.750 --> 10:02.270
I'm afraid they can't travel.

10:02.270 --> 10:04.200
Besides, we don't have enough horses.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.120
How can we leave?

10:05.120 --> 10:06.200
On the brink of disaster,

10:06.200 --> 10:09.260
why care about the lives
of those from Lingji Mountain?

10:14.030 --> 10:15.510
Are you going to abandon them?

10:15.510 --> 10:16.030
Or

10:16.360 --> 10:17.760
do you have a better idea?

10:18.120 --> 10:19.910
It's a matter of life and death, Senior.

10:19.910 --> 10:21.240
Don't be soft-hearted.

10:21.550 --> 10:22.480
Must you drag down

10:22.480 --> 10:23.550
our Tianyuan Sect disciples

10:23.550 --> 10:24.320
to die here?

10:24.390 --> 10:25.170
Do you want it?

10:25.170 --> 10:27.440
All disciples of the immortal sects
are one family.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.440
If we unite as one,

10:28.550 --> 10:29.750
we might be able to leave together.

10:29.750 --> 10:30.510
Bai Zongying,

10:30.510 --> 10:31.510
let me remind you.

10:32.030 --> 10:33.600
Even if you are
the sect's Heavenly Talent,

10:33.600 --> 10:35.080
you must consider the Master's orders

10:35.080 --> 10:37.280
and the disciples of our Tianyuan Sect.

11:04.870 --> 11:05.730
Qinghong Sect.

11:07.790 --> 11:08.850
Here we meet again.

11:09.200 --> 11:11.060
So the ones who ambushed us before

11:11.390 --> 11:12.120
were you.

11:19.550 --> 11:21.630
We have never offended the Qinghong Sect.

11:21.630 --> 11:22.480
You burned

11:22.480 --> 11:23.840
a huge library of ours,

11:24.440 --> 11:25.960
and you call that not offending us?

11:25.960 --> 11:27.200
Before coming to North Xiang,

11:27.200 --> 11:28.480
the elders in our sect
already sent a letter

11:28.480 --> 11:29.480
to your sect master.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.870
Whatever the grievances,

11:30.870 --> 11:32.390
the Tianyuan Sect
has given an explanation.

11:32.390 --> 11:33.720
I don't know about that.

11:34.410 --> 11:35.290
I only know

11:35.870 --> 11:36.550
that today,

11:37.030 --> 11:38.870
none of you will escape.

11:39.790 --> 11:40.510
Senior Bai,

11:41.480 --> 11:43.680
why waste words with this enchantress?

12:16.080 --> 12:16.600
Bitch!

12:57.400 --> 12:58.460
What are you doing?

12:59.200 --> 13:00.460
And what are you doing?

13:11.390 --> 13:12.160
Take her away first.

13:12.160 --> 13:13.820
No, we should leave together.

13:14.510 --> 13:15.240
Go! Hurry!

13:15.670 --> 13:16.360
Senior Bai!

14:15.030 --> 14:16.560
You saved An and the others?

14:17.080 --> 14:17.630
Yes.

14:18.600 --> 14:19.730
You're still alive.

14:21.150 --> 14:21.670
Yes.

14:22.360 --> 14:23.560
He didn't die either.

14:24.960 --> 14:26.290
He was alive when I left.

14:29.910 --> 14:31.040
Where are you going?

14:31.200 --> 14:32.130
If he's not dead,

14:32.430 --> 14:34.360
my senior sister will be in danger.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.750
You are not completely

14:35.750 --> 14:36.630
heartless.

14:41.750 --> 14:43.480
You've been waiting for me here

14:43.560 --> 14:45.290
just to ask me these questions?

14:46.480 --> 14:47.680
What else could it be?

14:47.960 --> 14:49.000
Are you waiting

14:49.000 --> 14:50.130
for me to apologize?

14:50.600 --> 14:51.960
Isn't it just one word?

14:52.480 --> 14:53.680
Is it that important?

14:56.510 --> 14:57.150
Fine.

14:58.240 --> 15:01.550
♪ Hear the Gu curse
turn into cries for help ♪

14:58.600 --> 14:59.320
Sorry.

14:59.870 --> 15:00.870
Can I leave now?

15:01.480 --> 15:02.200
Why?

15:01.610 --> 15:05.520
♪ Blood-stained hand, sword drawn ♪

15:02.750 --> 15:03.680
What do you mean?

15:04.120 --> 15:05.630
Why did you treat me like this?

15:05.550 --> 15:09.020
♪ Trapped in Qianyan Cave ♪

15:05.960 --> 15:07.020
What did I do to you?

15:07.510 --> 15:09.050
You and I crossed paths by chance,

15:09.050 --> 15:12.520
♪ Even hell must be broken free from ♪

15:09.270 --> 15:10.930
and you did this voluntarily.

15:11.600 --> 15:12.750
I already told you

15:13.390 --> 15:14.550
to stay away from me.

15:13.650 --> 15:16.830
♪ With every stroke of hatred ♪

15:15.150 --> 15:16.390
You didn't listen.

15:16.850 --> 15:20.870
♪ Let it grow into a dagger I wear ♪

15:18.510 --> 15:19.440
Why are you looking at me

15:19.440 --> 15:20.300
with that look?

15:20.890 --> 15:23.130
♪ No need to show me mercy there ♪

15:21.120 --> 15:22.380
Didn't your master say

15:22.840 --> 15:23.840
I am your tribulation?

15:23.160 --> 15:26.990
♪ Let me take every blow ♪

15:24.790 --> 15:25.720
Now you have gotten over

15:25.720 --> 15:26.780
this tribulation.

15:27.750 --> 15:28.610
You should go back now.

15:28.610 --> 15:32.710
♪ Drag my wounds through the hollow road ♪

15:29.240 --> 15:30.750
Go achieve your great Dao.

15:32.740 --> 15:36.020
♪ I'll pluck the passion
locked in my brow ♪

15:36.040 --> 15:39.410
♪ At the end of the mountains,
I pick up fireflies now ♪

15:38.030 --> 15:38.720
What?

15:39.430 --> 15:43.580
♪ Burn me down, I feel no pain ♪

15:39.840 --> 15:41.640
Do you want to take revenge on me?

15:42.150 --> 15:43.600
You've lost an arm now,

15:43.620 --> 15:45.210
♪ I believe Heaven sees all ♪

15:44.510 --> 15:45.750
so you might not be my match.

15:45.230 --> 15:47.500
♪ Its wrath shines upon demons ♪

15:47.680 --> 15:51.060
♪ But who will show me mercy? ♪

15:48.910 --> 15:49.870
Didn't you say

15:50.440 --> 15:52.120
the core of fate never changes?

15:51.220 --> 15:52.740
♪ I believe I'm innocent ♪

15:52.770 --> 15:58.070
♪ Turned into dust and scattered away ♪

15:52.910 --> 15:53.480
Why

15:54.480 --> 15:56.740
didn't you foresee what I've done to you?

15:57.080 --> 15:58.480
You remember what I said.

15:58.820 --> 16:00.400
♪ I accept the blame of
numerous accusations ♪

15:59.200 --> 16:00.740
Why don't you remember my kindness?

16:00.740 --> 16:03.200
♪ I offer no defense ♪

16:03.230 --> 16:06.130
♪ To protect what I believe is worth it ♪

16:05.320 --> 16:06.390
The day I fell to the bottom of the cliff,

16:06.310 --> 16:07.950
♪ I admit my heart
is as hard as iron and stone ♪

16:07.320 --> 16:08.670
I was attacked
by countless poisonous bugs.

16:07.970 --> 16:10.250
♪ Call me cold if you must ♪

16:09.360 --> 16:10.000
I was already exhausted

16:10.000 --> 16:11.000
dealing with them.

16:10.380 --> 16:13.000
♪ I'll risk it all ♪

16:11.240 --> 16:12.370
Then when your fa...

16:17.630 --> 16:18.960
When Xia Xuanzi woke up,

16:19.790 --> 16:21.390
I knew I was no match for him.

16:21.790 --> 16:23.000
Only by using my bracelet did I

16:22.310 --> 16:25.620
♪ Hear the Gu curse
turn into cries for help ♪

16:23.000 --> 16:23.930
barely survive.

16:24.440 --> 16:25.150
I thought you would definitely

16:25.150 --> 16:26.120
come back for me.

16:25.680 --> 16:29.150
♪ Blood-stained hand, sword drawn ♪

16:27.390 --> 16:28.390
I even thought

16:29.300 --> 16:32.770
♪ Trapped in Qianyan Cave ♪

16:29.390 --> 16:30.360
when you came back,

16:30.360 --> 16:32.090
what if I couldn't protect you?

16:32.800 --> 16:36.280
♪ Even hell must be broken free from ♪

16:36.270 --> 16:38.200
I walked out of Qianyan Cave step by step.

16:37.410 --> 16:40.580
♪ With every stroke of hatred ♪

16:40.440 --> 16:41.200
Don't you have anything

16:40.610 --> 16:44.620
♪ Let it grow into a dagger I wear ♪

16:41.200 --> 16:42.330
you want to say to me?

16:44.270 --> 16:45.390
You remember all that stuff.

16:44.640 --> 16:46.890
♪ No need to show me mercy there ♪

16:46.320 --> 16:47.390
But how come you don't remember

16:46.910 --> 16:50.750
♪ Let me take every blow ♪

16:47.390 --> 16:48.990
a single bad thing others do?

16:49.120 --> 16:50.380
Me, going back for you?

16:51.320 --> 16:52.120
Don't forget

16:52.120 --> 16:53.320
how you fell down the cliff.

16:52.370 --> 16:56.460
♪ Drag my wounds through the hollow road ♪

16:54.360 --> 16:55.160
Don't you feel

16:55.790 --> 16:57.200
even a bit happy seeing me?

16:56.490 --> 16:59.770
♪ I'll pluck the passion
locked in my brow ♪

16:59.790 --> 17:03.160
♪ At the end of the mountains,
I pick up fireflies now ♪

17:03.180 --> 17:07.339
♪ Burn me down, I feel no pain ♪

17:05.400 --> 17:07.480
I am the daughter of Xia Xuanzi.

17:07.380 --> 17:08.960
♪ I believe Heaven sees all ♪

17:08.069 --> 17:09.440
Whether I admit it or not,

17:08.980 --> 17:11.250
♪ Its wrath shines upon demons ♪

17:10.000 --> 17:11.000
I am his daughter.

17:11.430 --> 17:14.810
♪ But who will show me mercy? ♪

17:11.790 --> 17:13.510
I am heartless by nature.

17:14.920 --> 17:16.160
The earlier you realize it,

17:14.980 --> 17:16.490
♪ I believe I'm innocent ♪

17:16.520 --> 17:21.819
♪ Turned into dust and scattered away ♪

17:16.829 --> 17:18.359
the better it'll be for you.

17:18.720 --> 17:20.050
If you don't want to die,

17:20.680 --> 17:22.010
just stop following me.

17:22.569 --> 17:24.150
♪ I accept the blame of
numerous accusations ♪

17:24.170 --> 17:26.530
♪ I offer no defense ♪

17:26.550 --> 17:30.030
♪ To protect what I believe is worth it ♪

17:30.160 --> 17:31.800
♪ I admit my heart
is as hard as iron and stone ♪

17:31.820 --> 17:34.100
♪ Call me cold if you must ♪

17:34.240 --> 17:36.850
♪ I'll risk it all ♪

17:37.620 --> 17:44.740
♪ All guilt falls on me ♪

17:45.620 --> 17:52.690
♪ I've owed far too much ♪

17:52.850 --> 17:59.940
♪ Just let my heart rot completely ♪

18:00.560 --> 18:07.970
♪ Just see me as the demon in your eyes ♪

18:08.070 --> 18:09.650
♪ I believe Heaven sees all ♪

18:09.680 --> 18:11.940
♪ Its wrath shines upon demons ♪

18:12.120 --> 18:15.500
♪ But who will show me mercy? ♪

18:15.530 --> 18:18.740
♪ I accept this trial of love
fate has given me ♪

18:18.760 --> 18:23.190
♪ I take in both love and hate alike ♪

19:30.110 --> 19:30.920
Vajra Xunmu.

19:34.640 --> 19:35.720
What's with her?

19:36.270 --> 19:37.070
Vajra Xunmu,

19:37.410 --> 19:38.350
Lord Tiling captured her

19:38.350 --> 19:39.440
on the way back.

19:40.110 --> 19:41.000
The Lord ordered us

19:41.000 --> 19:42.130
to lock her up first.

19:44.200 --> 19:45.510
What are you looking at?

19:45.510 --> 19:46.680
You already end up here,

19:46.680 --> 19:48.210
and you are still so fierce.

19:50.130 --> 19:50.990
Give me a smile,

19:51.720 --> 19:52.980
and I'll give you a gift

19:53.440 --> 19:54.900
that you definitely like.

19:55.620 --> 19:56.280
How's that?

19:58.640 --> 19:59.510
How boring.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.220
Come with me.

20:01.720 --> 20:02.650
Take her with us.

20:10.550 --> 20:11.160
Sheng?

20:14.200 --> 20:14.750
Sheng!

20:17.680 --> 20:18.240
Sheng!

20:19.880 --> 20:20.740
Senior Sister?

20:21.240 --> 20:21.590
Sheng.

20:21.590 --> 20:22.050
Senior!

20:22.110 --> 20:22.480
Sheng.

20:22.480 --> 20:22.940
Senior!

20:23.920 --> 20:24.850
Why are you here?

20:26.030 --> 20:26.640
See?

20:27.200 --> 20:29.110
I told you there's a gift

20:29.130 --> 20:30.460
you'd definitely like.

20:30.510 --> 20:31.710
What did you do to her?

20:32.150 --> 20:32.960
Are you blind?

20:33.350 --> 20:34.880
Can't you see for yourself?

20:35.790 --> 20:36.650
Senior Sister,

20:37.000 --> 20:37.790
I'm fine.

20:40.350 --> 20:41.410
Let me check on you.

20:48.720 --> 20:49.590
How moving.

20:50.400 --> 20:51.510
Since you're finally reunited,

20:51.510 --> 20:53.310
you must have a lot to catch up on.

20:53.640 --> 20:54.830
I'll leave you to it.

20:55.310 --> 20:56.030
Anyway,

20:56.160 --> 20:57.820
you don't have much time left.

21:00.820 --> 21:02.350
They are having a reunion.

21:02.380 --> 21:03.750
Why are you standing still here?

21:03.750 --> 21:04.350
What?

21:04.830 --> 21:05.920
Do you want me to find you

21:05.920 --> 21:07.070
a paramour in prison?

21:07.070 --> 21:08.550
I saw you looking so jealous,

21:08.550 --> 21:10.010
so I wanted to comfort you.

21:10.960 --> 21:12.220
Why would I be jealous?

21:12.660 --> 21:14.090
When the living meet the living,

21:14.090 --> 21:15.270
it's called a reunion.

21:15.270 --> 21:17.830
When the living meet the dead,
it's called visiting a grave.

21:17.830 --> 21:18.960
-Does it hurt?
-Look at you.

21:18.960 --> 21:20.200
-No, it doesn't.
-You must have no family.

21:20.200 --> 21:21.510
If you are really envious,

21:21.510 --> 21:22.840
you can go visit a grave.

21:23.000 --> 21:24.400
But make sure you get the right grave.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.790
Don't visit the wrong one.

21:25.790 --> 21:27.090
Even if you are willing to kneel,

21:27.090 --> 21:28.150
they might not want to acknowledge

21:28.150 --> 21:30.010
an unworthy descendant like you.

21:44.720 --> 21:45.480
Too weak.

21:46.440 --> 21:47.160
Come again.

21:48.590 --> 21:49.720
You want to die, huh?

21:50.120 --> 21:51.680
Don't rush. One at a time.

21:52.500 --> 21:54.030
Your turn will come anyway.

21:57.510 --> 21:59.480
Bring the boy from Lingji Mountain over.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.880
Lock him up with this one.

22:00.920 --> 22:03.240
How were you injured by the Qinghong Sect?

22:03.240 --> 22:03.880
I'm fine.

22:04.310 --> 22:05.710
It doesn't hurt anymore.

22:06.880 --> 22:07.720
Then how were you caught

22:07.720 --> 22:08.720
and brought here?

22:08.830 --> 22:10.290
What about Tang You and An?

22:10.350 --> 22:11.350
Are they here too?

22:12.400 --> 22:14.240
I sent them back to the Central Plains.

22:14.240 --> 22:15.480
The "Unparalleled Secret Magic" was
also safely

22:15.480 --> 22:16.280
brought back.

22:17.030 --> 22:18.030
Glad to hear that.

22:18.480 --> 22:19.940
Then why did you come back?

22:21.790 --> 22:24.120
That bastard, Xia Xuanzi, is still alive.

22:24.550 --> 22:25.880
I was worried about you.

22:27.160 --> 22:27.960
Silly Sheng.

22:28.400 --> 22:30.060
You shouldn't have come back.

22:30.790 --> 22:32.190
Thankfully, I came back.

22:32.660 --> 22:34.510
Otherwise, being thousands of miles
away from you,

22:34.510 --> 22:36.310
I wouldn't know if you were safe.

22:39.240 --> 22:41.240
How were you caught, Senior Sister?

22:42.550 --> 22:43.750
Where is Lu Qianqiao?

22:43.750 --> 22:44.750
Why isn't he here?

22:45.640 --> 22:47.370
He left you behind and ran away?

22:49.160 --> 22:50.310
It's a long story.

23:04.170 --> 23:06.690
[Liubo Temple]

23:37.550 --> 23:38.350
When I woke up,

23:38.960 --> 23:39.960
I saw Rust-Sword.

23:43.030 --> 23:44.160
Why did the Qinghong Sect

23:44.160 --> 23:45.790
set up such a huge maze formation?

23:45.790 --> 23:46.850
What are they up to?

23:50.750 --> 23:52.880
To hunt down immortal sect disciples.

23:52.920 --> 23:54.830
Those lunatics from the Qinghong Sect

23:54.830 --> 23:55.640
want the immortal perception

23:55.640 --> 23:57.500
inside the cultivators' bodies.

23:57.790 --> 23:59.520
But they are also cultivators.

23:59.800 --> 24:03.130
Why would they dig out
other people's immortal perception?

24:03.480 --> 24:04.070
Yeah.

24:05.070 --> 24:05.920
Why?

24:26.070 --> 24:26.750
Master.

24:29.160 --> 24:30.550
How is Niankong?

24:31.060 --> 24:31.770
Dharma King Niankong was

24:31.770 --> 24:33.640
hit in the heart meridian by Bai Zongying.

24:33.640 --> 24:34.960
His blood is flowing in reverse.

24:34.960 --> 24:36.160
It doesn't look good.

24:36.680 --> 24:37.810
What a coincidence.

24:38.310 --> 24:38.830
Master,

24:39.350 --> 24:40.920
it just so happens that
there are
cultivators

24:40.920 --> 24:42.400
at Nascent Soul
in this batch of human pills.

24:42.400 --> 24:43.550
We can use them to refine

24:43.550 --> 24:45.960
the golden liquid
to prolong Niankong's life.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.350
The elderly Niankong

24:47.510 --> 24:49.590
has been at the Nascent Soul stage
for nearly a decade.

24:49.590 --> 24:50.720
This time, he was even

24:50.720 --> 24:51.440
severely injured

24:51.440 --> 24:54.400
by a junior who had just reached
the Nascent Soul stage.

24:54.400 --> 24:56.790
How does he have the face
to take this golden liquid?

24:56.790 --> 24:58.750
Niankong is one of our Qinghong Sect.

24:58.750 --> 24:59.880
No matter what he did

25:00.110 --> 25:01.400
or whether he is useful,

25:01.400 --> 25:02.530
we must protect him.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.110
After all,

25:04.510 --> 25:06.640
closeness and distance are

25:07.200 --> 25:08.730
quite easy to distinguish.

25:09.070 --> 25:10.400
How do you distinguish?

25:19.840 --> 25:21.750
Isn't it just a Nascent Soul cultivator?

25:21.750 --> 25:23.550
There is more than one in prison.

25:23.830 --> 25:25.200
I'll go catch one.

25:32.920 --> 25:33.780
Senior Sister,

25:34.550 --> 25:35.350
are you tired?

25:35.880 --> 25:37.410
Would you like to take a nap?

25:38.160 --> 25:39.290
I can't fall asleep.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.160
It's right ahead.

25:54.880 --> 25:55.940
What are you doing?

25:58.510 --> 25:59.310
Take her away.

26:00.310 --> 26:01.790
Don't you dare hurt my senior sister!

26:01.790 --> 26:02.790
Come at me if you have the guts!

26:02.790 --> 26:03.590
Don't touch them!

26:03.590 --> 26:04.310
Bullying two girls

26:04.310 --> 26:05.970
doesn't make you any tougher!

26:10.440 --> 26:11.000
Sheng!

26:11.730 --> 26:13.390
Don't touch my senior sister!

26:17.070 --> 26:17.720
Sheng!

26:18.480 --> 26:19.000
Sheng.

26:22.830 --> 26:23.480
No.

26:23.880 --> 26:24.550
Don't.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.400
Take me away with you.

26:26.640 --> 26:27.310
Take me!

26:27.740 --> 26:29.190
Do you really want to die?

26:29.600 --> 26:30.460
Don't hurt her.

26:30.860 --> 26:31.790
I'll go with you.

26:31.960 --> 26:32.620
As you wish.

26:33.350 --> 26:34.210
Why waste time?

26:34.960 --> 26:36.350
The Master is still waiting.

26:36.350 --> 26:36.880
Hurry up.

26:37.310 --> 26:38.000
No.

26:38.510 --> 26:39.370
Senior Sister,

26:39.920 --> 26:40.980
don't go with them.

26:41.240 --> 26:41.880
No!

26:42.270 --> 26:43.000
Don't worry.

26:43.550 --> 26:44.350
I'll be fine.

26:45.830 --> 26:46.630
Take her away.

26:47.160 --> 26:47.680
No.

26:49.270 --> 26:49.720
Senior Sister.

26:49.720 --> 26:50.160
Go!

26:51.790 --> 26:52.350
Senior Sister!

26:52.350 --> 26:52.950
Let her go!

26:53.270 --> 26:54.590
-Let her go!
-Senior Sister!

26:54.590 --> 26:55.350
Let her go!

27:02.310 --> 27:03.310
Senior Sister...

27:17.440 --> 27:20.300
[Liubo Temple]

27:25.310 --> 27:27.410
[Liubo Temple]

28:43.340 --> 28:47.930
[Tomb of Duan Xianyin, my dear master]

28:55.400 --> 28:56.350
What is this?

28:57.070 --> 28:58.270
How could Master die?

29:02.370 --> 29:04.600
[Erected by Disciple Lu Qianqiao]

29:06.110 --> 29:07.400
Why is my name on it?

29:08.790 --> 29:10.120
I set up this tombstone?

29:11.200 --> 29:12.240
If I set it up,

29:13.640 --> 29:15.240
how come I don't remember it?

29:17.160 --> 29:17.680
Lu,

29:17.960 --> 29:18.400
I...

29:39.640 --> 29:41.840
Sachets, pouches, and small pendants!

29:42.940 --> 29:44.460
Come and take a look!

29:46.480 --> 29:47.680
Small pendants!

30:08.480 --> 30:11.920
[Duan Xianyin from Liubo Temple]

30:58.920 --> 30:59.510
Come in.

31:37.240 --> 31:39.840
The War Demon's physique is
truly mysterious.

31:40.150 --> 31:41.520
You feel no pain,

31:42.240 --> 31:44.000
and your wounds heal quickly.

31:56.140 --> 31:56.750
Qianqiao,

31:57.480 --> 31:59.080
how about we try again and see

31:59.510 --> 32:00.480
to what extent

32:01.310 --> 32:03.110
your wounds can heal?

32:31.680 --> 32:32.470
Time to eat.

32:33.110 --> 32:34.270
I don't like it.

32:35.230 --> 32:36.750
You have to eat even if you don't like it.

32:36.750 --> 32:38.550
She'll come beat you again soon.

32:39.110 --> 32:41.070
You won't survive if you don't eat.

32:45.110 --> 32:46.030
If you die,

32:46.960 --> 32:47.920
I'll die, too.

32:49.920 --> 32:50.880
Why?

32:52.720 --> 32:54.350
She bought me to serve you.

32:55.620 --> 32:56.420
If you die,

32:57.590 --> 32:59.250
she will beat me to death, too.

33:05.920 --> 33:06.510
Lu,

33:07.590 --> 33:08.310
do you think

33:08.880 --> 33:10.200
we can grow up safely?

33:11.640 --> 33:12.960
My family is dirt-poor.

33:12.960 --> 33:14.160
My father was in debt,

33:15.030 --> 33:15.960
so he sold me.

33:17.400 --> 33:19.200
He said that when I grow up,

33:19.970 --> 33:21.480
I can escape from the master's place

33:21.480 --> 33:22.810
and run back to find him.

33:23.070 --> 33:23.590
Lu,

33:24.880 --> 33:26.680
do you think I can grow up safely?

33:27.830 --> 33:28.560
I don't know.

33:29.510 --> 33:30.620
Even if I grow up,

33:31.440 --> 33:32.700
I won't go look for him.

33:33.730 --> 33:34.290
Lu,

33:35.070 --> 33:36.270
we have to survive.

33:39.340 --> 33:39.860
Lu,

33:40.590 --> 33:41.990
let's survive together.

33:57.880 --> 33:58.400
Master,

33:58.880 --> 34:00.680
it's time to take your medicine.

34:17.630 --> 34:18.550
You did it...

34:20.630 --> 34:21.560
Don't come over.

34:21.630 --> 34:22.469
Don't come any closer.

34:22.469 --> 34:23.730
Don't come any closer!

34:33.280 --> 34:34.440
Lu! Hurry!

34:53.590 --> 34:54.150
Lu,

34:55.840 --> 34:57.320
you've recalled everything?

34:57.320 --> 34:57.880
Yes,

34:59.030 --> 35:00.560
I've recalled everything.

35:06.030 --> 35:07.830
I was nothing but a piece of wood.

35:08.090 --> 35:09.380
You gave me the power

35:10.440 --> 35:12.040
to awaken my consciousness,

35:12.230 --> 35:14.760
so I could perceive everything
in this world.

35:15.070 --> 35:16.840
Back then, you were troubled by the past

35:16.840 --> 35:18.510
and had trouble falling asleep.

35:18.510 --> 35:19.840
I used spells

35:20.440 --> 35:21.100
to help you.

35:23.630 --> 35:25.280
My power comes from you.

35:26.150 --> 35:27.880
When you are strong, I am strong.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.410
When you are weak, I am weak.

35:29.920 --> 35:31.050
But unfortunately,

35:32.030 --> 35:33.430
now that you are injured,

35:34.880 --> 35:36.320
my power can't hold on,

35:37.670 --> 35:39.240
and the memory is unlocked.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.070
Lu,

35:41.580 --> 35:42.840
I've never figured out

35:43.480 --> 35:44.320
why you sealed

35:44.320 --> 35:45.720
this part of your memory.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.730
Duan Xianyin maltreated you.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.360
She was a heretical cultivator.

35:49.360 --> 35:50.800
She took you as her disciple

35:50.800 --> 35:51.670
just in order to use you

35:51.670 --> 35:53.590
to get the body-tempering technique
of the War Demons.

35:53.590 --> 35:54.520
Someone like her

35:54.710 --> 35:55.670
deserved to die.

35:55.880 --> 35:56.880
Why feel guilty?

35:57.360 --> 35:58.560
It's not about guilt.

35:59.110 --> 36:00.070
Then why?

36:01.070 --> 36:03.070
Because I don't want to lie anymore.

36:03.670 --> 36:06.000
Humans always like to ask some questions.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.860
Where are you from?

36:07.890 --> 36:08.890
Where do you live?

36:09.360 --> 36:10.820
These were what I was asked

36:10.880 --> 36:12.340
most of the time back then.

36:12.670 --> 36:13.800
But where am I from?

36:14.550 --> 36:15.880
And where is my home?

36:16.710 --> 36:17.510
I am a half-blood

36:17.510 --> 36:18.910
of War Demons and humans.

36:19.400 --> 36:21.030
My father was a spy for the Human Race,

36:21.030 --> 36:23.230
hell-bent on wiping out the War Demons.

36:23.240 --> 36:25.030
My mother hated my father's betrayal

36:25.030 --> 36:26.490
and wanted to kill me, too.

36:27.150 --> 36:28.350
Caught in the middle,

36:28.510 --> 36:29.630
which side am I on?

36:29.840 --> 36:31.150
A person living in this world,

36:31.150 --> 36:31.960
with no roots,

36:32.510 --> 36:33.480
no home,

36:33.750 --> 36:34.520
is like

36:35.110 --> 36:36.230
a lost soul.

36:38.590 --> 36:39.670
So you sealed away

36:39.670 --> 36:40.400
that memory,

36:40.840 --> 36:41.840
lying to yourself

36:42.590 --> 36:44.590
that you came from Liubo Temple
in North Xiang

36:44.590 --> 36:46.650
and had a master who treated you well.

36:47.190 --> 36:48.070
So stupid.

36:49.110 --> 36:50.840
Yes, so stupid.

37:20.960 --> 37:21.590
Senior,

37:22.480 --> 37:23.410
Randeng is back.

37:25.580 --> 37:26.980
Greetings, Sect Master.

37:30.030 --> 37:31.290
Why are you back alone?

37:32.280 --> 37:34.080
While pursuing the Wushuang Society,

37:34.080 --> 37:35.840
I was ambushed by the Qinghong Sect

37:35.840 --> 37:37.110
and got separated from the others.

37:37.110 --> 37:37.840
Where is Bai?

37:38.880 --> 37:39.760
Senior Bai

37:40.150 --> 37:40.880
insisted on protecting

37:40.880 --> 37:42.450
the disciples of Lingji Mountain.

37:42.450 --> 37:43.230
I tried to persuade him,

37:43.230 --> 37:44.440
but he refused to leave.

37:44.440 --> 37:45.000
Later,

37:45.320 --> 37:47.320
the people from the Qinghong Sect
caught up.

37:47.320 --> 37:49.670
He asked me to take Jiang Ji
and leave first.

37:49.670 --> 37:51.530
As for what happened to him later,

37:53.760 --> 37:54.590
I don't know.

37:56.150 --> 37:57.230
If Bai falls into

37:57.230 --> 37:58.820
the hands of the Qinghong Sect,

37:58.820 --> 38:00.260
I'm afraid things won't end well.

38:00.260 --> 38:02.070
Should we send someone to look for him?

38:02.070 --> 38:03.230
Randeng, when did you and Bai

38:03.230 --> 38:04.280
split up?

38:05.630 --> 38:06.760
At least 10 days ago.

38:11.480 --> 38:12.360
It's too late.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.000
Miss Xin,

38:55.400 --> 38:56.760
you're finally awake.

38:58.030 --> 39:00.110
I heard that in just a few months,

39:00.110 --> 39:03.880
your cultivation level rose
from the Qi Refining stage to Nascent Soul.

39:03.880 --> 39:04.880
How did you do it?

39:08.480 --> 39:10.140
You're from an immortal sect,

39:10.230 --> 39:12.550
yet why are you mixed up with the people

39:12.730 --> 39:14.260
from the Wushuang Society?

39:14.360 --> 39:15.960
Which side are you really on?

39:16.400 --> 39:17.760
And which side are you on?

39:17.760 --> 39:19.710
You are the master of the Sihe Library,

39:19.710 --> 39:20.440
yet you sat by and watched

39:20.440 --> 39:21.760
the people from immortal sects

39:21.760 --> 39:23.480
burn all the books.

39:24.440 --> 39:25.970
Since you are a cultivator,

39:26.230 --> 39:29.160
why are you secretly hunting down
those from the immortal sects?

39:29.160 --> 39:30.840
In the name of the Qinghong Sect,

39:30.840 --> 39:33.370
you lurk in the dark
doing despicable things.

39:33.400 --> 39:35.000
Who on earth are you? A human or a ghost?

39:35.000 --> 39:36.330
You're sharp-tongued.

39:36.670 --> 39:38.960
No wonder Lu Qianqiao likes you.

39:40.770 --> 39:41.900
Who on earth are you?

39:42.480 --> 39:43.230
Me?

39:44.530 --> 39:45.860
I am a devil

39:45.920 --> 39:47.360
who crawled out of hell,

39:47.550 --> 39:49.000
the knife that helps people cut out

39:49.000 --> 39:50.510
rotten flesh,

39:50.670 --> 39:52.550
your restless inner desires,

39:52.880 --> 39:53.680
and above all,

39:54.000 --> 39:55.710
endless destruction.

39:56.360 --> 39:57.000
I am

39:57.630 --> 39:59.290
the king of all living beings,

39:59.550 --> 40:01.150
the Nirvana Divine Phoenix!

40:02.330 --> 40:04.360
You really know how to flatter yourself.

40:04.360 --> 40:05.440
How dare you!

40:06.110 --> 40:07.810
Master, don't waste your breath on her.

40:07.810 --> 40:09.140
Let's just dig out her immortal perception

40:09.140 --> 40:10.510
and throw her out to feed the dogs!

40:10.510 --> 40:11.710
How stubborn you are.

40:12.030 --> 40:13.110
What a waste

40:13.110 --> 40:15.510
of such an excellent immortal perception.

40:17.030 --> 40:18.360
Please hold on, Master.

40:18.880 --> 40:20.190
This woman has close ties

40:20.190 --> 40:21.190
with Lu Qianqiao.

40:21.500 --> 40:22.360
Keeping her alive

40:22.360 --> 40:23.280
might help us lure

40:23.280 --> 40:24.280
Lu Qianqiao here.

40:25.030 --> 40:25.630
Yingying,

40:26.320 --> 40:28.280
we're only taking her immortal perception,

40:28.280 --> 40:29.440
not her life.

40:30.020 --> 40:31.400
We'll just feed her several bowls of tonic

40:31.400 --> 40:32.460
and spare her life.

40:32.670 --> 40:34.800
And we can still lure him into our trap.

42:05.590 --> 42:06.320
What's going on?
